  "description": "Official .NET client for the AssinaJá public API — electronic and qualified signatures under eIDAS, with Chave Móvel Digital.\n\nCreate documents from PDF or DOCX templates, send them for signature, follow each signer's progress, and download the signed PDF and its completion report. Also covers the organization, its plan and quotas, upload links, and the webhook signing secret.\n\nGenerated from the published OpenAPI contract, so it matches the server by construction. Requires an organization API key in the X-Api-Key header.",
